# Drafty

3 active posts + 1 draft, page_size=2: 2 pages. The draft is excluded from
the count and the windows in this root's build (no --drafts). The sibling
fixture at tests/drafts/pagination builds the same content WITH --drafts,
where the draft becomes active and the arithmetic becomes 4 items / 2 pages.
